log
@Handle locales such as fr_FR where a comma is used to delimit the decimal
part of a floating point number - functions wcsutil_str2double() and
wcsutil_double2str() substitute for sscanf() and sprintf() when dealing
with floating point numbers.  Patch provided by Michael Droettboom.
